  "snippet": "Basalt is a local inference engine for large language models: Qwen3.8-Flash-Next, DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash and Qwen3.8-27B. It runs on an NVIDIA Blackwell GPU (sm_120) on Linux and Windows x64, with what does not fit in VRAM (the experts of a mixture-of-experts model) in system RAM…",
